<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ADVANTA CHAMPIONSHIP WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ADVANTA CHAMPIONSHIP WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Advanta</p>
<p>Championship women's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat Amy Frazier (U.S.) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Lori McNeil (U.S.) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>8-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Zina Garrison-Jackson (U.S.),</p>
<p>walkover</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Kimberly Po (U.S.) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
